{
  "_comment": [
    "The validation modes this module knows, one entry per action tag. This file is the single source:",
    "php/ModeRegistry.php reads it for the server, and tests/gen_mode_registry.cjs writes the browser's copy",
    "into js/engine.js (CI fails when that copy is stale). Adding a mode means adding an entry here plus the",
    "methods it names; tests/registry_php.php lists the hand-written places that must also name the new tag.",
    "Order matters: tags are read in this order, and branchKeys/clientKeys are unions in this order.",
    "refKeys kinds: cond = a condition string (role gate = decides whether the rule applies, role test =",
    "the verdict itself); fieldList = a list of field names the rule reads; operand = one field reference whose",
    "value the verdict reads (op = the key the browser gets the folded operand under, value = the key the",
    "server's extended compile writes the resolved value to). An operand's optional withholdIf names a rule key,",
    "or a list of them: when one is true and the operand cannot be resolved, only the operand is withheld (the page checks what",
    "does not need it and says why the rest is not checked, under <op>Why; the audit judges the rest and logs",
    "the operand's part as not checked) instead of the whole rule being switched off.",
    "snapshotAdvisory (optional): the mode's page factory turns only the parts that read a snapshot advisory",
    "(snapshotFields), so the extended path keeps the rule's blockSave unless a condition read a snapshot.",
    "serverKeys (optional): keys the server needs and the page must not carry; they are removed from every",
    "rule and branch before the page config is written (ModeRegistry::clientShape).",
    "uniformBranchKeys (optional): branch keys every rule sharing one field must give the same value (a list is",
    "compared as a set), mapped to the option name the refusal shows; a difference makes the field a",
    "configuration error (Branching::conflictOf). refKeys role lookup = a field read only to look values up in",
    "other records, so saving its form does not re-check the rule.",
    "textKeys (optional): rule keys an annotation may give as a map of language id to text instead of one string;",
    "a key may be a path into the tag's JSON, steps joined by \".\" and \"*\" for every key of an object (show.chart.labels.*).",
    "The parser keeps the key a plain string (the default text, which the audit, the scan and pages without",
    "Multi-Language Management show) and puts the other languages under \"i18n\" (AnnotationRules::takeTexts), so a",
    "mode that lists textKeys must also list \"i18n\" in its branchKeys and clientKeys.",
    "bareValue (optional): how an unquoted, non-JSON tag value ends: token (the first space, the default) or condition",
    "(the tag's bare value is a condition, read whole up to the end of the line or the next action tag; see Logic::parsePrefix).",
    "surveySave (optional): complete = a survey response is judged only once it is complete. The save audit skips the",
    "mode's rules on a survey save whose response is still open (a page turn, Previous Page, Save & Return Later), and",
    "on a survey page the buttons of common.partialSaveButtons, which save without finishing, do not wait for them."
  ],
  "common": {
    "refKeys": [
      {"key": "when", "kind": "cond", "role": "gate", "ast": "whenAst"}
    ],
    "surveyShape": {
      "_comment": ["What a survey page's config keeps of a rule and of each branch (ModeRegistry::clientShape). The page is public,",
                   "so it carries nothing a respondent must not read; the page shows none of it on a survey anyway.",
                   "drop: keys removed. presence: keys the page only tests for being there; a list becomes [\"\"], an object",
                   "keeps its keys with \"\" as each value. conditionText: the text that replaces a condition (a refKeys entry of",
                   "kind cond with an ast) whose AST is sent, since the page evaluates the AST. A rule deferred as a whole",
                   "(deferred, not deferredOnSave) never reads its conditions: it sends conditionText with [\"const\", true]. A rule with a",
                   "configError keeps only its type, its fields and configErrorText."],
      "drop": ["deferredWhy"],
      "presence": ["snapshotFields", "growthChartWhy"],
      "conditionText": "(condition)",
      "configErrorText": "this check is not set up correctly; the study team can see the details on the data entry form."
    },
    "partialSaveButtons": ["submit-btn-saveprevpage", "submit-btn-savereturnlater"]
  },
  "modes": [
